      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222511/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill a Collins glass with 1 1/2 cups ice; set aside in the freezer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6GnW8nkINKLJkrT-YvYEW-6MJO4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222511-tom-collins-cocktail--ddmfs-step-02-1-fdd8b86b1789414ab70eb8d843b94953.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222511/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine gin, lemon juice, and simple syrup in a cocktail shaker. Add 1 cup ice, cover, and shake until chilled.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zZp4ztU3fwwiqPsjnv-0ubzRYVg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222511-tom-collins-cocktail--ddmfs-step-03-1-f5a2a249d0bc4a3b8465df18c1a1bce9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222511/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain into the chilled Collins glass.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XLTjlXDpEulYxL0r9kZkJ_wFMBM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222511-tom-collins-cocktail--ddmfs-step-04-1-dcc39d93cfa24496b076a0edc6dc68e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222511/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with club soda and garnish with lemon wedge. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
